OL,3,GNEWSAMan made video before woman's
OL,4,Adeath, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murdering a woman he
OL,7,Fmet on a fetish website shot a video of
OL,8,Fher before her death in which he
OL,9,Fordered her to repeat that she wanted
OL,10,Fto be beaten and made to suffer, a
OL,11,Fcourt in the United States has heard.
OL,13,FDwain Hall, whose online user name was
OL,14,FAlpha Sadist, is accused of the kidnap
OL,15,Fand murder of 32-year-old Sonia Exelby,
OL,16,Ffrom Southsea in Hampshire.
OL,18,FThe recovered footage, which had been
OL,19,Fdeleted from Hall's phone, was played
OL,20,Fto the Florida court where the
OL,21,F54-year-old is on trial.
