OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury had previously heard from
OL,7,Fprosecutors that Hall was a predator
OL,8,Fwho had manipulated his mentally ill
OL,9,Fvictim and then stabbed her to death
OL,10,F"for his own sadistic pleasure". Hall
OL,11,Fdenies the charges.
